; Models: a crash cymbal, a burst of highpassed noise and metallic squares decaying over three seconds | Neglects: the bell | IO: (t) -> amplitude | Tags: drum
crop(0.85*(highpass(sample(rand(t, seed=41)), cutoff=4500, q=0.7)*(0.6*exp(-t/0.9) + 0.4*exp(-t/0.08)) + 0.4*highpass(sample(square(523)*square(737) + 0.5*square(1013)), cutoff=3000, q=0.7)*exp(-t/0.5)), 0s, 3.5s, rise=0.0003s, fall=1.2s)
